      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-119567\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/262#3086\">Relating the Length of the Shorter Leg to the Length of the Longer Leg</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"119567\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-119567\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>In the triangle above, what is the length of the shorter leg?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 12:49 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:14</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
